{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be2b58db982a551acb21ae9243670c91331ee6b1c1a01a1d1e1938499b1061e9","ja":"マイナスをプラスに","zh":"把负数变成正数","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d71342a0747cf4049bf43c4c2fbe628ed186ea8db70ae97a8b5044ac0e9d4f2a","ja":"そして、雑誌の取材が始まって……","zh":"然后，杂志的采访开始了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"487d1de8e2256657b8f97b51077b14c2a59ac6f9de2d27d6592a544962288b2d","ja":"ひゃあっ！？　今、静電気がバチって……！\nでも、体に電気が走って、健康になった気がするねぇ♪","zh":"呀啊！？刚才被静电啪地电了一下……！\n不过，电流穿过身体，感觉变得更健康了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"23befe41c825478a7839c0ca0102ef601f864467a61e3d4e5f67fb7dcee20cd0","ja":"あっ、ミキもバチ！ってなったの！　じゃあ、\nやよいにも静電気の健康をおすそ分けしてあげるね♪","zh":"啊，美希也被啪！地电到了！那美希\n也把静电的健康分给弥生一点吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f6092713052f17d374173cae9c9775bbb7b9f39210194b86fb3fa52c93a6ace5","ja":"えっ？　えーと……\nはい、ありがとうございます……？","zh":"诶？　那个……\n好的，谢谢您……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"fdebbf539be44fbac3b43eb6200d94438b0581a8b275f02e2e6e532fae8e2c4a","ja":"あれ？　新しいペンなのにインクがでないねぇ……？\nでも、書くところを間違えてたからよかったべさ♪","zh":"哎呀？明明是新买的笔，怎么不出水呢……？\n不过，幸好本来写的地方也搞错了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c6e9048e02664ed986683617794d21539da47df1a77789d39c39ff0c50bdf66f","ja":"ミキのはちゃんと書けるけど、\nミキも書くとこ間違えちゃったの。","zh":"美希的虽然能好好写出来，\n但美希也把写的地方搞错了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"10d60333441427f64720bd63f6464d330ce5a332dcd4d4d25fcc700d2b9aefa2","ja":"でも、もっといいこと思いついて\n書きなおしたかったから、よかったって思うな☆","zh":"不过，我想到了更好的点子，\n本来就想重写，所以觉得正好呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c32f37f2de0905aa27062b1bc246549a2c57966515392308185f1ca17729810c","ja":"はぁ……やっぱり、\n取材の時も運が悪かったねぇ……。","zh":"唉……果然，\n接受采访的时候运气也很差呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3b2c1b37ab4002a953599fbb3c2b58bf25ae67373b62951bb9ae04489179aac4","ja":"記者さんもビックリしてたの。\n不運って、重なるときは重なっちゃうんだね。","zh":"记者先生也吓了一跳。\n倒霉的事，赶到一起时还真就会接连发生呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c69e8647f811cd543f7687396d77d850861ddb53ea27d6a16408e4fb08201c97","ja":"でもでも、記者さんは気にしてないって\n言ってくれてたよ。","zh":"不过不过，记者说他并不介意哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"1f119b5f6dff573cbb6054cee86f1b533f587670cc601db2952b146919bb41dd","ja":"でもあたし、美希さんと一緒に\nマイナスとマイナスをプラスにできなかったべさ……。","zh":"可是我，没能和美希小姐一起\n化负为正啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3a78b35028fc909a5e069aaf94058a80be3afb891065b16396d4dbb6762b1cfe","ja":"ミキ的にはそんなことないって思うな。\n取材にはちゃんと答えられてたし。","zh":"美希觉得不是那样的哦。\n接受采访时也好好回答了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"91df5f5a946f10f5b9c3ac10745a73297ccc21701dc370f783915a600348a0c5","ja":"それに運が悪いことも、笑い話にできてたの☆","zh":"而且运气不好的事，也能当成笑话讲出来呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d11afa7f94859f767fd75e46a28a2b6f3a4ba9ee27399702753fc734fb6ff560","ja":"私もすごく楽しい取材になってたって思うよ。","zh":"我也觉得那是一次非常开心的采访哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"56d029a0591b3a885362e1171448630e4673d3e4e0547c50df01a0ff75ca8340","ja":"美希さんもやよいさんも、ありがとねぇ。","zh":"美希、还有弥生，谢谢你们呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1336.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"1ebbbd3b0d5e24a6d8fa685c1965e6d82413da690b8f4c45236876cd073bc544","ja":"記者さんも、\nそう思ってくれてたらいいんだけども……。","zh":"要是记者先生也能这么想\n就好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
